msgstr "Agar bu video hisob talab qilsa, Arroxy Kashfiyot orqali kirishingizdan avtomatik foydalanadi. U boshqa sababga ko'ra mavjud bo'lmasligi mumkin."

msgctxt "wizard.formats.cookiesError.exploreSignedIn.heading"
msgid "Signed in to Explore"
msgstr "Kashfiyotga kirilgan"

msgctxt "wizard.formats.cookiesError.exploreSignIn.body"
msgid "If this video needs a YouTube account, sign in in Explore and retry. Arroxy uses that sign-in only when a download needs it."
msgstr "Agar bu video YouTube hisobini talab qilsa, Kashfiyotga kiring va qayta urinib ko'ring. Arroxy bu kirishdan faqat yuklab olish uchun kerak bo'lganda foydalanadi."

msgctxt "wizard.formats.cookiesError.exploreSignIn.cta"
msgid "Sign in in Explore"
msgstr "Kashfiyotga kirish"

